      "message": "fix(2d): rest pass keeps corner reliefs on the rest center boundary\n\nA 2D Pocket rest pass with a corner relief filtered the planned reliefs\nwith a bare point-in-region test on the rest center area. Each relief\nstart is a vertex of the pocket's center area, on the boundary of the\nrest center area, so the test kept a relief by rounding: 1 of 4 dogbones\non a sharp 30 x 30 mm pocket.\n\nThe filter now tests the rest center area grown by 0.01 mm. A relief\nthat the rest pass does not keep gives a toolpath note.\n\nFixes #3146\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
